# Focus AI - Supabase Configuration
# 
# HOW TO USE:
# 1. Copy this file as ".env" (remove .example)
# 2. Fill in your actual values from Supabase dashboard
# 3. Keep this file SECRET - never commit to git
#
# GET YOUR CREDENTIALS:
# Go to: https://app.supabase.com
# Navigate to: Settings → API
# Copy:
#   - Project URL → SUPABASE_URL
#   - Service Role Secret → SUPABASE_KEY (NOT the 'anon key')

# Supabase Project URL
# Format: https://[project-id].supabase.co
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co

# Service Role Secret Key (for admin/backend operations)
# This is a JWT token - keep it SECRET!
# ⚠️  DO NOT use the 'anon' key - must be Service Role Secret
SUPABASE_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJzdXBhYmFzZSIsInJlZiI6I...

